  "What did he ﷺ say Ibrahim has?": ["Bukhari 1382: 'inna lahu murdi'an fil-jannah.' What does he have?", "A garden", "A house", "A river"],
  "Young children who die are in Allah's care.": "Bukhari 1382: 'inna lahu murdi'an fil-jannah': young children who die are in Allah's care.",
