  "What else is forbidden?": ["Muslim 972a: 'wa la tusallu ilayha.' What else?", "Plant on them", "Stand near them", "Read Quran there"],
  "This keeps worship for Allah alone.": "Muslim 972a: 'wa la tusallu ilayha': this keeps worship for Allah alone.",
