  "What do we ask Allah for?": ["Muslim 975: 'as'alullaha lana wa lakumul-'afiyah.' What do we ask?", "Mercy for them only", "A long life for us", "Light for the graves"],
  "The dua reminds us we will die too.": "Muslim 975: 'wa inna in sha'allahu bikum la-lahiqun': we will die too.",
