  "When exactly did he ﷺ begin?": ["Bukhari 1514: 'hina qamat bihi naqatuhu.' At what moment?", "When he left Madinah", "After praying", "When he saw the Kabah"],
  "Dhul-Hulaifah is the miqat for people from Madinah.": "Bukhari 1514: 'min dhil-hulayfah': this is the miqat of Madinah.",
