  "What does la sharika laka mean?": ["Bukhari 1550: 'la sharika laka labbayk.' What does it mean?", "You are near", "You are one of many", "You are the King"],
  "The talbiyah praises Allah for all blessings.": "Bukhari 1550: 'innal-hamda wan-ni'mata laka wal-mulk': the talbiyah praises Allah for all blessings.",
