  "Did he ﷺ leave the same way?": ["Bukhari 1577: 'wa kharaja min asfalaha.' Did he leave the same way?", "He never left", "By ship", "Yes, the same"],
  "Aishah told this hadith.": "Bukhari 1577: ''an 'a'ishah: dakhala min a'laha': Aishah told this hadith.",
  "In how many rounds is ramal done?": ["Bukhari 1604: 'sa'a thalathata atwaf.' In how many rounds is ramal?", "The first four", "The last three", "The first two"],
  "What about the other four rounds?": ["Bukhari 1604: 'wa masha arba'ah.' And the other four?", "Ramal too", "Faster still", "Standing still"],
  "A tawaf has seven rounds.": "Bukhari 1604: 'thalathata atwafin wa masha arba'ah': a tawaf has seven rounds.",
  "Which corners did he ﷺ touch?": ["Bukhari 1609: 'lam ara an-nabiyya ﷺ yastalimu minal-bayti illar-ruknaynil-yamaniyayn.' Which corners?", "The door and roof", "The Syrian corners", "The Hijr wall"],
  "The Black Stone sits in one of...?": ["Bukhari 1609: 'ar-ruknaynil-yamaniyayn.' Where is the Black Stone?", "The roof", "The door", "The Hijr"],
  "Ibn Umar watched closely how he ﷺ did tawaf.": "Bukhari 1609: 'lam ara an-nabiyya ﷺ yastalimu illar-ruknayn': Ibn Umar watched closely.",
  "How many rak'ahs did he ﷺ pray at Mina?": ["Bukhari 1656: 'salla bina... rak'atayn.' How many?", "Three", "Four", "Eight"],
  "Were they in danger then?": ["Bukhari 1656: 'wa nahnu akthara ma kunna qattu wa amanuh.' Were they in danger?", "Yes, in war", "Yes, in a storm", "They were hiding"],
  "Shortening prayer was a gift, not only for fear.": "Bukhari 1656: 'akthara ma kunna qattu wa amanuh': shortening was a gift, not just for fear.",
  "Which prayers were joined at Muzdalifah?": ["Bukhari 1674: 'jama'a rasulullahi ﷺ fi hajjatil-wada'i bil-muzdalifah.' Which two prayers?", "Asr and Maghrib", "Fajr and Dhuhr", "Dhuhr and Asr"],
  "Muzdalifah comes after...?": ["Bukhari 1674: 'bil-muzdalifah' in the Farewell Hajj. After which day?", "Day of Mina", "Day of Eid", "Day of Tarwiyah"],
  "Abu Ayyub al-Ansari told this hadith.": "Bukhari 1674: ''an abi ayyub: jama'a... bil-muzdalifah': Abu Ayyub told this.",
  "Who was sent early from Muzdalifah?": ["Bukhari 1678: 'ana mimman qaddamahun-nabiyyu ﷺ laylatal-muzdalifati fi da'afati ahlih.' Who was sent early?", "The elders", "The guards", "The men of Quraysh"],
  "What does this show about Islam?": ["Bukhari 1678: 'fi da'afati ahlih.' What does this show?", "It is always hard", "Rules never change", "Only the rich matter"],
  "Ibn Abbas was a boy then.": "Bukhari 1678: 'ana mimman qaddamah': Ibn Abbas was a boy then.",
  "What did the men do with their hair?": ["Bukhari 1729: 'halaqa rasulullahi ﷺ wa ta'ifatun min ashabih, wa qassara ba'duhum.' What did they do?", "Left it", "Washed it", "Covered it"],
  "Both shaving and shortening were done.": "Bukhari 1729: 'halaqa... wa qassara ba'duhum': both shaving and shortening were done.",
  "What did he ﷺ say about the mixed-up order?": ["Bukhari 1734: 'la haraj.' What did he ﷺ say?", "Give a sheep", "Fast three days", "Redo them"],
  "Which rites were asked about?": ["Bukhari 1734: 'dhabahtu qabla an armi... halaqtu qabla an adhbah.' Which rites?", "Tawaf and sa'i", "Ihram and talbiyah", "Arafah and Muzdalifah"],
  "He ﷺ made Hajj easy for people.": "Bukhari 1734: 'la haraj': he ﷺ made Hajj easy for people.",
