  "Who is excused from it?": ["Bukhari 1755: 'illa annahu khuffifa 'anil-ha'id.' Who is excused?", "The old", "Travellers", "Children"],
  "The farewell tawaf is done on arrival in Makkah.": "Bukhari 1755: 'akhiru 'ahdihim bil-bayt': the farewell tawaf is done on arrival.",
  "What did Abu Bakr do when a better choice came?": ["Bukhari 6621: 'illa ataytul-ladhi huwa khayr wa kaffartu 'an yamini.' What did Abu Bakr do?", "Kept the oath no matter what", "Forgot the oath", "Made a new oath"],
  "Before the expiation came, did Abu Bakr break oaths?": ["Bukhari 6621: 'lam yakun yahnathu fi yaminin qattu hatta anzalallahu kaffaratal-yamin.' Before that?", "Once", "Sometimes", "Each year"],
  "An oath can be broken for something better, with expiation.": "Bukhari 6621: 'ataytul-ladhi huwa khayr wa kaffartu': an oath can be broken for better, with expiation.",
  "What is the bigger sin here?": ["Bukhari 6625: 'man istalajja fi ahlihi bi-yaminin fa-huwa a'zamu ithma.' Bigger sin?", "Making no oath", "Swearing quietly", "Asking for advice"],
  "What should he do instead?": ["Bukhari 6625: 'laysa tughni al-kaffarah.' The oath harms family. What should he do?", "Swear again", "Leave home", "Stay silent"],
  "Our family should not be hurt by our oaths.": "Bukhari 6625: 'man istalajja fi ahlihi bi-yamin': our family should not be hurt by our oaths.",
