  "What are we told to do?": ["Bukhari 5033: 'ta'ahadul-qur'an.' What do we do?", "Memorise once only", "Hide it", "Leave it"],
  "Once memorised, the Quran never leaves us.": "Bukhari 5033: 'ta'ahadul-qur'an': once memorised, the Quran never leaves.",
