  "We should speak about the Quran with care.": "Bukhari 5039: 'bal nussiya': we speak about the Quran with care.",
  "When should we stop for a while?": ["Bukhari 5061: 'fa-idhakhtalaftum fa-qumu 'anh.' When stop?", "When tired", "When it is late", "When hungry"],
