  "What had he learned?": ["Bukhari 5035: 'wa qad qara'tul-muhkam.' What had he learned?", "The long surahs", "Surah al-Baqarah", "The first juz"],
  "Children can learn many surahs by heart.": "Bukhari 5035: 'wa ana ibnu 'ashr': children can memorise many surahs.",
